            "content": "### CPU energy, not the electricity bill\nRAPL measures the processor package. Drives, the external enclosure, PSU losses and the TV require a separate meter.\n\n**Comparing changes:** use matched quiet periods and the same time range. A reboot can be marked with a Grafana annotation.\n\n**Missing readings:** check Energy telemetry. New counters need two scrapes. Gaps are never filled with zero.\n\nAverage power uses observed samples; energy totals depend on counter coverage. Hover a panel’s information icon for details."
